<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>The Beauty of Nature (中文)</title><link>https://www.franzgraf.de</link><description>一次徒步摄影体验</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 18:34:02 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>黑莓与一片出乎意料干燥的高山草甸</title><link>https://www.franzgraf.de/blog/2026/blackberries-and-a-surprisingly-dry-alpine-meadow/</link><description/><pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 18:34:02 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>弗兰肯瑞士 — 徒步与历史</title><link>https://www.franzgraf.de/blog/2026/frankische-schweiz-hiking-and-history/</link><description>&lt;a href="https://www.franzgraf.de/blog/2026/frankische-schweiz-hiking-and-history/" rel="nofollow" title="弗兰肯瑞士——徒步与历史"&gt;&lt;img alt="" height="150" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://www.franzgraf.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/DSC01046-150x150.jpg" width="150"/&gt;&lt;/a&gt;在弗兰肯瑞士度过一周——城堡、洞穴和远离人群的幽静小路。没有高山攀登，只有漫长而翠绿的徒步，穿越茂密的森林和布满苔藓的山谷。这里被低估、宁静且充满惊喜。以下是我们七篇文章（及几个视频）的旅程记录。如果你喜欢避开游客潮探索，这个地方正适合你。祝阅读愉快！</description><pubDate>Tue, 21 Jul 2026 18:55:28 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>从波滕施泰因到天堂（弗兰肯瑞士第六天）</title><link>https://www.franzgraf.de/blog/2026/from-pottenstein-to-heaven-day-6-in-the-frankische-schweiz/</link><description/><pubDate>Tue, 21 Jul 2026 04:58:23 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>普雷茨费尔德、瓦勒瓦特与一辆蒸汽机车（弗兰肯瑞士第五天）</title><link>https://www.franzgraf.de/blog/2026/pretzfeld-the-wallerwarte-and-a-steam-locomotive-day-5-in-the-frankische-schweiz/</link><description/><pubDate>Sun, 19 Jul 2026 07:34:21 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>徒步格斯韦因施泰因：城堡、洞穴与河谷（弗兰肯瑞士第四天）</title><link>https://www.franzgraf.de/blog/2026/hiking-around-gossweinstein-castle-caves-and-river-valleys-day-4-in-the-frankische-schweiz/</link><description/><pubDate>Sat, 18 Jul 2026 11:29:03 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>